      "why": "Because this instrument has a field-emission source, it can directly resolve the shape and dimensions of larger gold nanoparticles and nanorods (typically above 15–20 nm) deposited on a conductive substrate. However, if your nanoparticles are smaller than ~10–15 nm, TEM (EQ11) will provide much sharper boundaries and more accurate sizing.",
      "accessories_to_confirm": [
