      "technique": "Thermogravimetric analysis (TGA)",
      "why": "TGA determines the decomposition onset temperature so you can set a safe upper temperature limit for the DSC run, and it can quantify any inorganic filler content needed to normalize the polymer mass when calculating percent crystallinity. The tested milligram aliquot is destroyed during heating.",
